rline underline-offset-4 group-[.island-home]/site:mobile:max-wide:text-nav-compact group-[.island-home]/site:max-mobile:text-small nav-phone whitespace-nowrap max-[1021px]:hidden max-mobile:block group-[.island-home]/site:mobile:max-wide:hidden" href="tel:+13213239776">Call (321) 323-9776</a> <a href="/quote/?service=move" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-control-gap rounded-lg border no-underline transition-[transform,background,border-color] duration-200 motion-safe:not-disabled:hover:-translate-y-0.5 motion-safe:active:translate-y-0 disabled:cursor-wait disabled:opacity-70 border-transparent bg-sea-dark text-white shadow-[0_8px_22px_rgba(0,101,145,.16)] hover:bg-teal active:bg-teal min-h-[50px] px-control-x text-nav font-extrabold group-[.island-home]/site:mobile:max-wide:text-nav-compact group-[.island-home]/site:max-mobile:text-small max-mobile:w-full group-[.island-home]/site:mobile:max-wide:px-3">Get a Quote</a> </nav> </div> </header> <script type="module">const t=document.querySelector(".mobile-toggle"),n=document.querySelector("#nav-links");t?.addEventListener("click",()=>{const s=n?.classList.toggle("open")??!1;t.setAttribute("aria-expanded",String(s))});document.addEventListener("click",s=>{const e=s.target;if(!(e instanceof Node))return;const o=document.querySelector(".nav-services");o?.open&&!o.contains(e)&&(o.open=!1),n?.classList.contains("open")&&!n.contains(e)&&!t?.contains(e)&&(n.classList.remove("open"),t?.setAttribute("aria-expanded","false"))});document.addEventListener("keydown",s=>{if(s.key!=="Escape")return;const e=document.querySelector(".nav-services");e?.open?(e.open=!1,e.querySelector("summary")?.focus()):n?.classList.contains("open")&&(n.classList.remove("open"),t?.setAttribute("aria-expanded","false"),t instanceof HTMLElement&&t.focus())});</script> <main id="main-content" class="scroll-mt-20" tabindex="-1"> <section class="bg-mist pt-12 pb-14 max-mobile:pt-7 max-mobile:pb-9" aria-labelledby="move-hero-title"> <div class="mx-auto w-[min(calc(100%-40px),1180px)] max-mobile:w-[min(calc(100%-28px),1180px)] group-[.island-home]/site:max-mobile:w-[calc(100%-36px)] grid grid-cols-[.94fr_1.06fr] items-center gap-14 max-tablet:gap-8 max-mobile:grid-cols-1 max-mobile:gap-7"> <div> <p class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-3 text-eyebrow font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.12em] text-sea-dark"> <span class="h-px w-10 shrink-0 bg-sea" aria-hidden="true"></span> Move-in / move-out </p> <h1 id="move-hero-title" class="max-w-[700px] text-[clamp(2.7rem,4.5vw,4rem)] leading-[1.08] tracking-[-.03em] max-mobile:text-[2.65rem]">Leave the empty place clean—or start in one.</h1> <p class="mt-6 max-w-[620px] text-lede leading-[1.6] max-mobile:mt-4">Detailed cleaning for empty homes before a move-in, move-out inspection, listing, closing, or handoff.</p> <p class="mt-5 text-[1.2rem] font-bold text-sea-dark">From $350 per visit</p> <p class="mt-2 max-w-[620px] text-small">Starting prices give you a ballpark. We’ll confirm the actual price before you book based on the property, its condition, cleaning frequency, and any extras you want.</p> <div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-control-gap"> <a href="/quote/?service=move" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-control-gap rounded-lg border no-underline transition-[transform,background,border-color] duration-200 motion-safe:not-disabled:hover:-translate-y-0.5 motion-safe:active:translate-y-0 disabled:cursor-wait disabled:opacity-70 border-transparent bg-sea-dark text-white shadow-[0_8px_22px_rgba(0,101,145,.16)] hover:bg-teal active:bg-teal min-h-[50px] px-control-x text-action font-extrabold">Get a Quote<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a> <a class="text-small font-[750] text-sea-dark underline" href="tel:+13213239776">Call (321) 323-9776</a> </div> </div> <figure class="m-0 overflow-hidden rounded-panel bg-white shadow-[0_18px_55px_rgba(28,65,91,.09)]"> <img src="/images/cleaner-move-out.webp" alt="Man vacuuming an empty waterfront condo" class="aspect-[1.12] w-full object-cover object-left max-mobile:aspect-[1.5]" width="1280" height="800" fetchpriority="high"> </figure> </div> </section>   <section class="py-[74px] max-mobile:py-14" aria-labelledby="handoff-heading"> <div class="mx-auto w-[min(calc(100%-40px),1180px)] max-mobile:w-[min(calc(100%-28px),1180px)] group-[.island-home]/site:max-mobile:w-[calc(100%-36px)]"> <div class="grid grid-cols-[.72fr_1.28fr] gap-14 max-tablet:grid-cols-1 max-tablet:gap-6"> <div> <p class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-3 text-eyebrow font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.12em] text-sea-dark"> <span class="h-px w-10 bg-sea" aria-hidden="true"></span>
Plan the handoff
</p> <h2 id="handoff-heading" class="max-w-[500px]">A move clean works best around the property handoff.</h2> </div> <p class="max-w-[760px] text-[1.08rem] leading-[1.72]">For renters getting ready for an inspection, owners preparing a property for sale or handoff, and anyone who would rather move into a home that has already been cleaned.</p> </div> <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-3 border-y border-line max-tablet:grid-cols-1 max-tablet:divide-y max-tablet:divide-line"> <article class="py-7 pr-9 max-tablet:pr-0"> <p class="mb-2 text-eyebrow font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.11em] text-teal">Empty property</p> <h3>Do properties need to be completely empty?</h3> <p class="mt-3 text-[1rem] leading-[1.65]">Plan the clean for after belongings, furniture, and trash have been removed so we can reach the whole property. If furniture or belongings will still be there, tell us when you request a quote.</p> </article> <article class="border-l border-line px-9 py-7 max-tablet:border-l-0 max-tablet:px-0"> <p class="mb-2 text-eyebrow font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.11em] text-teal">Requirements</p> <h3>Have a checklist?</h3> <p class="mt-3 text-[1rem] leading-[1.65]">Send any landlord, buyer, or property-manager checklist with your quote request so we can confirm which tasks are covered.</p> </article> <article class="border-l border-line py-7 pl-9 max-tablet:border-l-0 max-tablet:pl-0"> <p class="mb-2 text-eyebrow font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.11em] text-teal">Timing</p> <h3>How much notice do I need to give for a move-out clean?</h3> <p class="mt-3 text-[1rem] leading-[1.65]">Book as early as you can, especially near the end of the month. We’ll confirm availability based on your move date and the scope of work.</p> </article> </div> </div> </section> <section class="border-y border-line py-[74px] max-mobile:py-14" aria-labelledby="scope-heading"> <div class="mx-auto w-[min(calc(100%-40px),1180px)] max-mobile:w-[min(calc(100%-28px),1180px)] group-[.island-home]/site:max-mobile:w-[calc(100%-36px)] grid grid-cols-[.88fr_1.12fr] items-center gap-16 max-tablet:grid-cols-1 max-tablet:gap-9"> <div> <div class="mb-8 border-l-4 border-teal bg-seafoam px-7 py-7 max-mobile:px-5"> <p class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-3 text-eyebrow font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.12em] text-sea-dark"> <span class="h-px w-10 bg-teal" aria-hidden="true"></span>
Empty-property cleaning
</p> <h2 id="scope-heading" class="max-w-[520px]">What we clean once the rooms are clear.</h2> </div> <div class="border-y border-line/90"> <div class="border-b border-line/90 py-5 last:border-b-0"> <p class="text-[1.04rem] leading-[1.58]">Everything included in a deep clean, throughout the empty property</p> </div><div class="border-b border-line/90 py-5 last:border-b-0"> <p class="text-[1.04rem] leading-[1.58]">Kitchen and bathroom detail cleaning</p> </div><div class="border-b border-line/90 py-5 last:border-b-0"> <p class="text-[1.04rem] leading-[1.58]">Inside empty kitchen and bathroom cabinets and drawers</p> </div><div class="border-b border-line/90 py-5 last:border-b-0"> <p class="text-[1.04rem] leading-[1.58]">Baseboards, doors, reachable trim, fixtures, window sills and tracks, and floors</p> </div><div class="border-b border-line/90 py-5 last:border-b-0"> <p class="text-[1.04rem] leading-[1.58]">Empty-room dusting and surface cleaning</p> </div><div class="border-b border-line/90 py-5 last:border-b-0"> <p class="text-[1.04rem] leading-[1.58]">Removal of light dust and debris left from moving out</p> </div> </div> </div> <figure class="m-0 overflow-hidden rounded-panel bg-white"> <img src="/images/move-out-empty-room.jpg" alt="Empty coastal room ready for a move-in or handoff" class="aspect-[1.28] w-full object-cover object-center max-mobile:aspect-[1.5]" width="1200" height="800" loading="lazy"> </figure> </div> </section> <section class="py-[74px] max-mobile:py-10" aria-labelledby="quote-heading"> <div class="mx-auto w-[min(calc(100%-40px),1180px)] max-mobile:w-[min(calc(100%-28px),1180px)] group-[.island-home]/site:max-mobile:w-[calc(100%-36px)] grid grid-cols-[1fr_1fr] gap-16 max-tablet:grid-cols-1 max-tablet:gap-12"> <div> <p class="mb-3 text-eyebrow font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.12em] text-sea-dark">Optional interiors</p> <h2 class="max-w-[520px]">Add the inside work your handoff requires.</h2> <p class="mt-5 max-w-[560px] text-[1.04rem] leading-[1.68]">Empty cabinet and drawer interiors are included. Add appliance interiors or interior window glass if your handoff requires them.</p> <div class="mt-7 border-y border-line"> <div class="grid grid-cols-[34px_1fr] items-start border-b border-line py-4 last:border-b-0"> <span class="font-black text-sea-dark" aria-hidden="true">+</span> <p class="font-[700] text-ink">Inside refrigerator and oven</p> </div><div class="grid grid-cols-[34px_1fr] items-start border-b border-line py-4 last:border-b-0"> <span class="font-black text-sea-dark" aria-hidden="true">+</span> <p class="font-[700] text-ink">Interior window glass</p> </div> </div> </div> <div> <p class="mb-3 text-eyebrow font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.12em] text-sea-dark">Quote factors</p> <h2 id="quote-heading" class="max-w-[500px]">What affects the price.</h2> <p class="mt-5 max-w-[560px] text-[1.04rem] leading-[1.68]">Your quote depends on the property’s size, layout, and condition. Empty cabinet and drawer interiors are included. Tell us if you also need appliance interiors or interior window glass cleaned.</p> <ul class="m-0 mt-5 grid list-none grid-cols-2 gap-x-5 border-t border-line p-0 self-start" role="list"> <li class="border-b border-line py-4 text-[.96rem] font-bold text-ink">Square footage</li><li class="border-b border-line py-4 text-[.96rem] font-bold text-ink">Property layout</li><li class="border-b border-line py-4 text-[.96rem] font-bold text-ink">Current condition</li><li class="border-b border-line py-4 text-[.96rem] font-bold text-ink">Appliance &amp; window extras</li> </ul> </div> </div> </section> <section class="py-[64px] max-mobile:py-12" aria-labelledby="deposit-heading"> <div class="mx-auto w-[min(calc(100%-40px),1180px)] max-mobile:w-[min(calc(100%-28px),1180px)] group-[.island-home]/site:max-mobile:w-[calc(100%-36px)] border-l-4 border-teal bg-seafoam px-9 py-9 grid grid-cols-[.7fr_1.3fr] gap-14 max-tablet:grid-cols-1 max-tablet:gap-5 max-mobile:px-6 max-mobile:py-7"> <div> <p class="mb-3 text-eyebrow font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.12em] text-sea-dark">Before the inspection</p> <h2 id="deposit-heading" class="max-w-[470px]">Does move-out cleaning guarantee I get my deposit back?</h2> </div> <p class="max-w-[760px] text-[1.05rem] leading-[1.7]">No. Your landlord or property manager decides how your deposit is handled. Share their cleaning checklist when requesting a quote so we can confirm which tasks we can cover.</p> </div> </section> <section class="border-y border-white/10 bg-ocean text-white py-[66px] max-mobile:py-12"> <div class="mx-auto w-[min(calc(100%-40px),1180px)] max-mobile:w-[min(calc(100%-28px),1180px)] group-[.island-home]/site:max-mobile:w-[calc(100%-36px)] grid grid-cols-[1fr_auto] items-center max-tablet:grid-cols-1 gap-10"> <div> <p class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-3 text-eyebrow font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.12em] text-cyan"><span class="h-px w-10 bg-cyan" aria-hidden="true"></span>Next step</p> <h2 class="max-w-[720px] leading-[1.1] tracking-[-.035em] text-white text-[clamp(2.25rem,4.2vw,3.8rem)]">Need a cleaner?</h2> <p class="mt-4 max-w-[680px] text-[1.02rem] leading-[1.65] text-white/70">Tell us what you need cleaned and when you need it. We’ll work through the details with you and confirm the price before anything is booked.</p> </div> <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 max-mobile:w-full max-mobile:[&>*]:grow"> <a href="/quote/?service=move" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-control-gap rounded-lg border no-underline transition-[transform,background,border-color] duration-200 motion-safe:not-disabled:hover:-translate-y-0.5 motion-safe:active:translate-y-0 disabled:cursor-wait disabled:opacity-70 border-transparent bg-white text-sea-dark hover:bg-mist active:bg-seafoam min-h-[50px] px-control-x text-action font-extrabold">Get a Quote<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a> <a href="tel:+13213239776" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-control-gap rounded-lg border no-underline transition-[transform,background,border-color] duration-200 motion-safe:not-disabled:hover:-translate-y-0.5 motion-safe:active:translate-y-0 disabled:cursor-wait disabled:opacity-70 border-[1.5px] border-white/70 bg-transparent text-white hover:border-white hover:bg-white/15 active:bg-white/25 min-h-[50px] px-control-x text-action font-extrabold">Call (321) 323-9776</a> </div> </div> </section>  </main> <footer class="footer bg-footer pt-7 pb-5 text-white group-[.island-home]/site:bg-footer max-mobile:pt-6 max-mobile:pb-[calc(64px+env(safe-area-inset-bottom))] group-[.no-mobile-bar]/site:max-mobile:pb-[max(20px,env(safe-area-inset-bottom))]"> <div class="mx-auto w-[min(calc(100%-40px),1180px)] max-mobile:w-[min(calc(100%-28px),1180px)] group-[.island-home]/site:max-mobile:w-[calc(100%-36px)]"> <div class="grid grid-cols-[1.3fr_.7fr_.7fr] gap-x-8 gap-y-5 max-mobile:grid-cols-2 max-mobile:gap-x-5"> <div class="max-mobile:col-span-2"> <a class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 whitespace-nowrap font-black tracking-[-.03em] text-mist no-underline group-[.island-home]/site:text-footer-text" href="/"> <span class="brand-mark relative size-[38px] shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-[50%_50%_46%_54%] bg-sea-dark group-[.island-home]/site:max-mobile:size-8" aria-hidden="true"></span> <span class="grid leading-none"> <span>Beachline Cleaners</span> <span class="mt-1.5 text-[.64rem] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.13em] text-cyan">Home &amp; Property Cleaning</span> </span> </a> <p class="mt-3 max-w-[430px] text-mist group-[.island-home]/site:text-footer-text max-mobile:hidden">Local cleaning for homes, moves, vacation rentals, and workspaces across the Space Coast.</p> <div class="mt-3 flex gap-4 font-extrabold text-mist group-[.island-home]/site:text-footer-text"> <a class="flex min-h-11 items-center no-underline" href="tel:+13213239776">(321) 323-9776</a> </div> </div> <div> <strong>Services</strong> <div class="mt-3 grid gap-0.5 text-mist group-[.island-hom